# Native Routed guide (Claude Code)
%% codex
# Native Routed guide (Codex)
%% end

Help the user pick and use the right native-routed skill. Reply in the user's language. For a Chinese-speaking user, use the `.zh-CN.md` versions of the references.

Before telling the user what a skill does, read that skill's `SKILL.md`. The summaries here are for orientation only.

## 1. Check readiness first

%% cc
Load the `native-routed-setup-{host}` skill in **check-only** mode (its `check` argument) and show its table. If any row the user's goal needs is not ✅, explain what's missing in one or two sentences and offer `/native-routed-setup-{host}` to fix it. Don't walk through a first run on a machine that isn't ready.
%% codex
